1
00:00:12,779 --> 00:00:18,489
Christmas used to overflow with grace,

2
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:24,820
Warm laughter filling up a crowded place.

3
00:00:25,039 --> 00:00:31,129
The ones I loved were sitting right beside,

4
00:00:31,699 --> 00:00:37,030
A golden circle that would never slide.

5
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:42,890
The winter lights still shine so bright and clear,

6
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:50,179
Yet every year I lose someone so dear.

7
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:57,289
We shared so many Christmases of yore,

8
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:02,409
Now standing all alone upon the floor.

9
00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:10,590
Soft carols play while memories return,

10
00:01:10,810 --> 00:01:16,950
Of hands that held me and of hearts that burn.

11
00:01:17,109 --> 00:01:23,219
Now empty chairs are staring in the gloom,

12
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:29,420
Where voices echoed in a brighter room.

13
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:35,269
The bells still ring with joy across the street,

14
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:42,000
While quiet grief is heavy at my feet.

15
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:48,700
I knew their warmth through every winter's chill,

16
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:55,709
Now facing all this silence, cold and still.

17
00:01:56,549 --> 00:02:01,010
Time takes away the ones who made me whole,

18
00:02:02,099 --> 00:02:08,199
Leaving a heavier ache inside my soul.

19
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:15,270
The tree still glows against the fading night,

20
00:02:17,349 --> 00:02:21,330
A fragile shadow of a vanished light.

21
00:02:23,650 --> 00:02:28,409
The world outside still celebrates the day,

22
00:02:29,979 --> 00:02:35,530
While all my dearest ones have slipped away.

23
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:43,210
We made our memories through years gone past,

24
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:53,030
Now solitude is all that's left at last.